guide.lpsm_mb:blocks.slabs.desc=A §lslab§r is a half-height version of its respective block.\n\n§lObtained:§r Crafted by placing 3 blocks in a slab like shape.\n\n§lVariants:§r GENERATED.\n
guide.lpsm_mb:blocks.layers.desc=§lLayer§r blocks are full blocks divided into up to 8 stackable layers that can be built up over time. Interacting while holding the same block adds more layers, increasing its height.\n\n§lObtained:§r Crafted by placing any block in the Stonecutter.\n\n§lVariants:§r GENERATED.\n
guide.lpsm_mb:blocks.vertical_slabs.desc=A §lvertical slab§r is a half-width version of its respective block.\n\n§lObtained:§r Crafted by placing 3 blocks in a vertical slab like shape.\n\n§lVariants:§r GENERATED.\n
